      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>  has exactly two solutions in (-1, 0) and exactly two solutions in (0, 2)",
